// Suede restarts itself when it is upgraded, which blanks every display
// the appliance drives. An upgrade is an operator's decision, taken
// between shows, never something a timer does overnight.
//
// unattended-upgrades already ignores the Suede repository because its
// origin is not in Allowed-Origins; this keeps that true for a machine
// whose policy was widened to every origin.
Unattended-Upgrade::Package-Blacklist { "suede"; };
